Publisher: inagpt
Display Name: INA GPT GmbH

To create publisher:
1. Go to https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/manage
2. Sign in with Microsoft account
3. Create publisher "inagpt"
4. Generate Personal Access Token (PAT) from Azure DevOps
5. Run: vsce login inagpt
6. Run: vsce publish

Or publish VSIX manually:
1. Build: vsce package
2. Upload at https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/manage
